WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.070
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.110
There is no Master of Butterflies!

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:11.620
Dr. Bright is not allowed to claim that, due
to her work with butterfly-related SCP items,

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:16.309
Researcher Zyn Kiryu is the "Master of Butterflies."

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:20.949
That is not an official position here at the
Foundation, and you need to stop pretending

00:00:20.949 --> 00:00:22.029
it is.

